<title>AUSTRALIA: Sumich increases full year loss forecast.</title>
<headline>Sumich increases full year loss forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horticulturist Sumich Group Ltd said on Monday it has revised its profit forecast for the full year to June 30 to a loss of A$3.7 million before tax as a result of below-budget revenues from its farm division.</p>
<p>Sumich said in February it expected to record a loss before tax and after abnormals in the second half about the same as in the first half when it posted a loss of A$975,000,</p>
<p>The company's other divisions are operating as previously forecast, Sumich said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
